**Describe the bug**
I am trying to display an AsyncImage in a Compose multiplatform project.

On Android nothing happens. I don't get an error message but neither `onSuccess` or `onError` is called. ( `onLoading` is called)
When I go back to the previous screen I can see the loading request being cancelled in the logs.

Any ideas?

Also I am finding it hard to gather exactly which dependencies I need to rely on to properly use Coil with compose multiplatform. There are various different articles on the web but the official Coil documentation does not seem very clear on this (unless I am missing something)

On Web (js) I get an error

**To Reproduce**

I am calling AsyncImage like this

```
 coil3.compose.AsyncImage(model = "https://fastly.picsum.photos/id/280/200/200.jpg?hmac=jjE26x23XLyRTL5st1-nb_BAHldv1V3JoFRn4g_nN04", contentDescription = "Art",
