 },
 onSuccess = {
 println("Success")
 },
 onError = {
 println("Error")
 } )

```

In my `App.kt` App() function I do:

```
 setSingletonImageLoaderFactory { context ->
 getAsyncImageLoader(context)
 }

```

And also in `App.kt` I have:

```
fun getAsyncImageLoader(context: PlatformContext)=
 ImageLoader.Builder(context).build()

```

**Logs/Screenshots**

No specific errors on Android.

On web (js) I get:

```
